"vip_info":{"is_vip":false,"target_url":null},"kvip_info":{"is_vip":false,"target_url":null},"level_info":null,"is_anonymous":false,"ring_info":null},"author_tag":[],"reply_author_tag":[],"content_tag":[],"comment_tag":[{"type":"ip_info","text":"广东","color":"#999999","night_color":"#999999","has_border":false}],"child_comment_count":0,"child_comment_next_offset":null,"child_comments":[],"is_visible_only_to_myself":false,"_":null,"level_tag":1,"is_gift":false,"disclaimer_info":null,"can_annotation":false,"is_annotation":false,"markdown":"白娘子传奇，说的就是许仙（人族）与白娘子（兽人）结合生下许仕林（人兽结合），许仕林通过科举考上权利阶层，利用手中权利把白娘子（兽人）放了出来，也暗示许仕林在帮助兽人破坏人族［大笑］［大笑］［大笑］"},{"id":"11604947784","type":"comment","resource_type":"answer","member_id":428669949,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/comment_v5/comments/11604947784","hot":false,"top":false,"content":"<p>并不是哈……因为不篡位才应该是华夏常态……秦汉以来不少政权，合法性真的不足……。</p><p>宋代弱内，而明代得天下也足够正，反倒是部分地方还是以秦汉的眼光来看待问题，防内到了魔怔的地步。[捂脸]</p><p><br></p><p>能决定辽东打不打的是皇帝，地方虽有腐败，但不知道努尔哈赤崛起这个是真说不过，因为鞑子的崛起挺缓慢的。</p><p>而皇帝死磕辽东……一个很大的原因是北京离那不远……，要知道朝廷连河套不磕……。</p><p><br></p><p>鞑清的崛起是万历朝廷失能的结果，而天下的灭亡则是朝廷整体失能的结果，这种政治体制是皇帝制定的，如果要为天下追责始作俑者，那就要问朱棣了……</p>","score":0,"comment_type":0,"created_time":1793066405,"is_delete":false,"collapsed":false,"reviewing":false,"reply_comment_id":"0","reply_root_comment_id":"11604947784","liked":false,"like_count":0,"disliked":false,"dislike_count":0,"is_author":false,"can_like":true,"can_dislike":true,"can_delete":false,"can_reply":true,"can_hot":false,"can_author_top":false,"is_author_top":false,"can_collapse":false,"can_share":true,"can_unfold":false,"can_truncate":false,"can_more":true,"author":{"id":"07b110c832da4a4c64d69033b5710009","url_token":"some-40-78","name":"some","avatar_url":"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-abed1a8c04700ba7d72b45195223e0ff_l.jpg?source=06d4cd63","avatar_url_template":"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-abed1a8c04700ba7d72b45195223e0ff_l.jpg?source=06d4cd63","is_org":false,"type":"people","url":"https://www.zhihu.com/api/v4/comment_v5/people/07b110c83